          "title": "巴黎的绿化",
          "content": "<p>巴黎的公用设施，强调绿色理念，会想方设法添加自然和绿化元素。</p>\n<p>比如，公交候车亭的柱子爬满了绿植。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202604/bg2026041808.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>候车亭的顶上也种了绿植。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202604/bg2026041809.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>路灯和书报亭也是这样。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202604/bg2026041810.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202604/bg2026041811.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>说实话，这个想法很好，问题是这些地方不适合植物生长，要么枯萎了，要么长得像杂草一样，看上去反而让人尴尬。</p>",
